    "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Gather and craft 100+ items<br></li><li> Build structures and craft equipment to aid your journey<br></li><li> Explore multiple distinct biomes with their own secrets to unlock<br></li><li> Level up to learn new skills and unlock recipes</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192860/extras/c0c0c21e4d4f35355ed79f6af1ee80c3.poster.avif?t=1742923513\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192860/extras/c0c0c21e4d4f35355ed79f6af1ee80c3.webm?t=1742923513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192860/extras/c0c0c21e4d4f35355ed79f6af1ee80c3.mp4?t=1742923513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Start small and work your way up to crafting advanced tools and structures that will help you along the way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192860/extras/048fad8afe0d25cd5e4636e53a6b294c.poster.avif?t=1742923513\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192860/extras/048fad8afe0d25cd5e4636e53a6b294c.webm?t=1742923513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192860/extras/048fad8afe0d25cd5e4636e53a6b294c.mp4?t=1742923513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Scavenge the world around you for vital resources. Every discovery could be the key to unlocking new possibilities and deeper secrets.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192860/extras/2b846c4ca32a9cc4865c3a4eace515d2.poster.avif?t=1742923513\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192860/extras/2b846c4ca32a9cc4865c3a4eace515d2.webm?t=1742923513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192860/extras/2b846c4ca32a9cc4865c3a4eace515d2.mp4?t=1742923513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore diverse and strange biomes to find the materials you need. Each area holds secrets waiting to be discovered.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience at your own pace</h2>Take your time to explore and create\u2014there\u2019s no rush and no violence in this mysterious, charming world.",
    "about_the_game": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Gather and craft 100+ items<br></li><li> Build structures and craft equipment to aid your journey<br></li><li> Explore multiple distinct biomes with their own secrets to unlock<br></li><li> Level up to learn new skills and unlock recipes</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192860/extras/c0c0c21e4d4f35355ed79f6af1ee80c3.poster.avif?t=1742923513\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192860/extras/c0c0c21e4d4f35355ed79f6af1ee80c3.webm?t=1742923513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192860/extras/c0c0c21e4d4f35355ed79f6af1ee80c3.mp4?t=1742923513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Start small and work your way up to crafting advanced tools and structures that will help you along the way.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192860/extras/048fad8afe0d25cd5e4636e53a6b294c.poster.avif?t=1742923513\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192860/extras/048fad8afe0d25cd5e4636e53a6b294c.webm?t=1742923513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192860/extras/048fad8afe0d25cd5e4636e53a6b294c.mp4?t=1742923513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Scavenge the world around you for vital resources. Every discovery could be the key to unlocking new possibilities and deeper secrets.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192860/extras/2b846c4ca32a9cc4865c3a4eace515d2.poster.avif?t=1742923513\" width=600 height=310 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192860/extras/2b846c4ca32a9cc4865c3a4eace515d2.webm?t=1742923513\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3192860/extras/2b846c4ca32a9cc4865c3a4eace515d2.mp4?t=1742923513\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Explore diverse and strange biomes to find the materials you need. Each area holds secrets waiting to be discovered.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience at your own pace</h2>Take your time to explore and create\u2014there\u2019s no rush and no violence in this mysterious, charming world.",
